oc\": \"summary\", \"q\": \"influenza activity remained low in October but has been slowly increasing since November\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The national and regional baselines are the mean percentage of visits for influenza-like illness (ILI) during noninfluenza weeks\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The epidemic threshold is set at 1.645 standard deviations above the seasonal baseline.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The seasonal baseline proportion of pneumonia and influenza (P&I) deaths is projected using a robust regression procedure\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Cumulative unadjusted incidence rates are calculated using CDC’s National Center for Health Statistics population estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Activity levels are based on the percentage of outpatient visits in a jurisdiction attributed to ILI\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}